 an active area of research in the AI development tools space.\n\n### Sources:\n- [Rosentic on Visalytica](https://www.visalytica.com/tool/rosentic)\n- [Rosentic on ProductCool](https://www.productcool.com/product/rosentic)\n\nThe tool appears to be positioned as a solution for teams using multiple AI coding agents simultaneously, helping to prevent integration issues before code is merged.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
